    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add Noxious Weeds to your wishlist! \ud83d\udc96</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/fde35b39645b1d91f86d6e65b6a10513.poster.avif?t=1733582505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/fde35b39645b1d91f86d6e65b6a10513.webm?t=1733582505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/b6a3429481faa4d7022fcdff6c378fdd.poster.avif?t=1733582505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/b6a3429481faa4d7022fcdff6c378fdd.webm?t=1733582505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The corruption is spreading! Hordes of evil creatures are coming your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a former adventurer who retired, looking for a peaceful farming life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you really think the days of dangerous adventures and fetch quests were finally over?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too bad, no cozy farming here! Grab the tools and slay the monsters before they taint your fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/e2776552e03a29ca2d93ef97f8ab6487.poster.avif?t=1733582505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/e2776552e03a29ca2d93ef97f8ab6487.webm?t=1733582505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/e2776552e03a29ca2d93ef97f8ab6487.mp4?t=1733582505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/9aaa1d314a6b092127f2bc0954ff7e43.poster.avif?t=1733582505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/9aaa1d314a6b092127f2bc0954ff7e43.webm?t=1733582505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/9aaa1d314a6b092127f2bc0954ff7e43.mp4?t=1733582505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/96712559e2bf2a3a8a6549ab57f0260d.poster.avif?t=1733582505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/96712559e2bf2a3a8a6549ab57f0260d.webm?t=1733582505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/96712559e2bf2a3a8a6549ab57f0260d.mp4?t=1733582505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/dd3b0b3b316cf6e44e3bda24e5a7c256.poster.avif?t=1733582505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/dd3b0b3b316cf6e44e3bda24e5a7c256.webm?t=1733582505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/dd3b0b3b316cf6e44e3bda24e5a7c256.mp4?t=1733582505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/53ed948827464b2109d985db1bfe7e94.avif?t=1733582505\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/5eaaa47dfd070466bd1f135bc347c87a.poster.avif?t=1733582505\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/5eaaa47dfd070466bd1f135bc347c87a.apng?t=1733582505\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resist waves of enemies through nights and days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 minutes play sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of upgradeable Tools to wipe out the swarm once and for all. Your belt can carry a maximum of 6; your choices will change the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue and team up with the cutest companions. Some will heal you, while others will fight at your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the perfect crop combination to achieve game-breaking builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility. Tweak monsters' health, speed, and damage to better suit your play style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/31c1422de46eb81bf1ea4a8ea14fe7fb.poster.avif?t=1733582505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/31c1422de46eb81bf1ea4a8ea14fe7fb.webm?t=1733582505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429310/extras/31c1422de46eb81bf1ea4a8ea14fe7fb.mp4?t=1733582505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 Tools to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >46 Harvest items for incredible builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3  Different companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spring season difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Characters and 6 crops unlockable through Steam Achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the masters of rogue-lite survivor/bullet hell games: Risk of Rain, Vampire Survivors, and Brotato.</p>",
